{"seq":3,"slug":"drying-concentration","title":"干燥与浓缩技术","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/food-processing/drying-concentration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"spray-freeze-drying","title":"喷雾干燥与冷冻干燥：从高效到高品质的干燥技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/food-processing/drying-concentration/spray-freeze-drying","wordCount":2783,"readingTime":12},{"seq":2,"slug":"osmotic-dehydration","title":"渗透脱水：温和前处理的传质工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/food-processing/drying-concentration/osmotic-dehydration","wordCount":3153,"readingTime":13},{"seq":3,"slug":"membrane-concentration","title":"膜浓缩技术：分子级别的冷浓缩","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/food-processing/drying-concentration/membrane-concentration","wordCount":2824,"readingTime":12}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"干燥与浓缩技术\">干燥与浓缩技术</h1><p>干燥（Drying）与浓缩（Concentration）是通过去除食品中水分来实现保藏目的的两大技术体系。其基本原理建立在水分活度（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）理论之上：当食品的水分活度降至微生物生长下限以下（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> &lt; 0.6 时几乎所有微生物停止生长），化学和酶促反应速率也大幅降低，食品即可实现长期稳定贮藏。</p>\n<p>干燥将食品水分含量降至 1-5%（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> &lt; 0.3），产品为固体粉末或片状；浓缩则将水分去除至中间水平（固形物含量从 10-15% 提高至 40-75%），产品保持液态或半固态形式。两者在技术原理上互补——干燥强调相变（液态水→气态水蒸气）的高效实现，浓缩则侧重于在保留挥发性风味的前提下选择性去除水分。</p>\n<p>本章介绍三种代表性技术：喷雾干燥与冷冻干燥作为干燥技术的两极（高温快速 vs 低温高品质）、渗透脱水作为温和预干燥方法、以及膜浓缩作为冷浓缩的现代方案。</p>\n"}